source_raw_tex:
\tilde g(x) 
=g(e^{\pi i(2\xi_1-1)},\ldots,e^{\pi i(2\xi_r-1)}) 
=\sum_{k\in J}c_ke^{\pi ik\dotproduct (2x-\tbf{1})} 
=\sum_{k\in J}(-1)^{k\tbf{.1}}c_ke^{2\pi ik\dotproduct x}

